I have a minimal PR to make this configurable via `tui.json` and disable it by default: https://github.com/anomalyco/opencode/pull/25540

Once merged you can configure the sound or animation independently (sound ignored if animate is off).

`~/.config/opencode/tui.json`

```json
{
  "$schema": "https://opencode.ai/tui.json",
  "logo": {
    "animate": false,
    "sound": false
  }
}
```

